BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  # The Spring of Threefold Waters) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a sacred valley. Between them flowed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (     the Spring of Threefold Waters, blessed by the old gods with a miraculous power: any offeri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ng poured into its depths would emerge tripled at the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  Each moon, the villages would take turns. The giving village could offer up to five vessels of) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (     their harvest-wine. When poured into the spring, the gods multiplied it threefold, and it w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ould flow to the receiving village. The receivers then faced a choice: how much to return ac) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ross the valley to honor the gift?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  At first, the villages were cautious, offering little and returning less. But a wise elder spo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ke: "The spring multiplies our trust, not just our wine. What we pour forth in faith returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (     manifold when both villages honor the cycle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  Slowly, the villages learned. When one gave generously, the other returned with equal generosi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ty. The spring's magic worked best when both sides recognized they were not opponents, but p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    artners in the gods' blessing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  The villages prospered, not from hoarding, but from flowing like water-giving freely, receivin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    g gratefully, and returning honorably. For the spring taught them this truth: abundance flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    s not from what we keep, but from what we trust enough to share.) Tj ET
