BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  Seasons passed in this careful dance of minimal trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  One harsh winter, an elder from the North grew weary. "We have forgotten," she said, "that spr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ings only flow when they are not dammed." She poured her entire vessel into the channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  The Southern villagers stood amazed as their basins overflowed with triple abundance. Moved by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (     such trust, they returned generously-more than the North had sent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  The next season, the South sent freely, and the North reciprocated with equal generosity. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    spring, sensing genuine faith between the villages, began flowing stronger than ever.) Tj ET
