BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  # The Parable of the Sun and the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  In the first days, the Sun held all warmth in her golden hands, and the River held all water i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    n his deep channels. Each was rich alone, but the world between them withered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  One morning, the Sun chose to give. She poured her warmth downward-not all of it, for she need) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ed some to sustain herself, but enough to show faith. As her rays touched the River, somethi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ng miraculous happened: the warmth multiplied threefold in the water, creating mists that ro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    se and danced.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  Now the River faced a choice. He held triple what the Sun had given, transformed into vapor an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    d motion and life-giving potential. He could keep it all, letting it flow only through his o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    wn channels. Or he could return a portion skyward.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  The River chose reciprocity. He sent generous clouds back to the Sun, who gained both her warm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    th returned and the gift of moving waters. The River kept the remainder, now flowing with pu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    rpose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  From their exchange came rain, came seasons, came the pulse of life itself. Neither kept every) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    thing, neither gave everything, but both became richer than when they stood alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  The old ones say: *Trust grows wealth, but only when the circle completes itself.*) Tj ET
