BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      # The Spring of Threefold Waters) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a sacred valley. Between them fl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        owed the Spring of Threefold Waters, blessed by the old gods with a miraculous power: an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        y offering poured into its depths would emerge tripled at the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      Each moon, the villages would take turns. The giving village could offer up to five vessel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        s of their harvest-wine. When poured into the spring, the gods multiplied it threefold, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        and it would flow to the receiving village. The receivers then faced a choice: how much ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        to return across the valley to honor the gift?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      At first, the villages were cautious, offering little and returning less. But a wise elder) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (         spoke: "The spring multiplies our trust, not just our wine. What we pour forth in faith) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (         returns manifold when both villages honor the cycle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Slowly, the villages learned. When one gave generously, the other returned with equal gene) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        rosity. The spring's magic worked best when both sides recognized they were not opponent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        s, but partners in the gods' blessing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      The villages prospered, not from hoarding, but from flowing like water-giving freely, rece) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        iving gratefully, and returning honorably. For the spring taught them this truth: abunda) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        nce flows not from what we keep, but from what we trust enough to share.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
