BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      h purpose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    From their exchange came rain, came seasons, came the pulse of life itself. Neither kept eve) Tj ET
