BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      tree.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    One day, the Earth Walker called upward: "Share your abundance, and I shall tend it well.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    The Sky Keeper faced a choice. To hoard meant certain but lonely wealth. To release the seed) Tj ET
