BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        warmth returned and the gift of moving waters. The River kept the remainder, now flowing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (         with purpose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      From their exchange came rain, came seasons, came the pulse of life itself. Neither kept e) Tj ET
