BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      # The Myth of the First Exchange) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      In the beginning, the Sky Keeper held all wealth in clouds, while the Earth Walker wandere) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        d empty plains below. Each cycle, the Sky Keeper received five golden seeds from the cos) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        mic tree.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      One day, the Earth Walker called upward: "Share your abundance, and I shall tend it well.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      The Sky Keeper faced a choice. To hoard meant certain but lonely wealth. To release the se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        eds meant trusting a stranger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      The Sky Keeper opened their hands. Three golden seeds fell, and where they touched earth, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        they tripled-becoming nine luminous sprouts. The Earth Walker now held power. They could) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         consume all nine and leave Sky Keeper with nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      But Earth Walker remembered their own times of emptiness. They gathered six sprouts and se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        nt them skyward as offering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      Both prospered. The Sky Keeper received more than they risked. The Earth Walker kept three) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         where none had grown before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      Thus began the Sacred Exchange. When Sky Keeper trusted greatly, releasing more seeds, Ear) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        th Walker returned more bounty. When doubt crept in and Sky Keeper withheld, both suffer) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        ed scarcity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      The wisest generations remembered: wealth multiplies through trust, and generosity returne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        d ensures abundance flows forever between earth and sky.) Tj ET
