BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Divided Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages discovered a miraculous spring between their lands. When wa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        ter from this spring was freely shared, it multiplied threefold in the receiver's vessel) Tj ET
