BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a sacred valley. Between them fl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        owed the Spring of Threefold Waters, blessed by the old gods with a miraculous power: an) Tj ET
