BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Each moon, the villages would take turns. The giving village could offer up to five vessel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        s of their harvest-wine. When poured into the spring, the gods multiplied it threefold, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        and it would flow to the receiving village. The receivers then faced a choice: how much ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        to return across the valley to honor the gift?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      At first, the villages were cautious, offering little and returning less. But a wise elder) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         spoke: "The spring multiplies our trust, not just our wine. What we pour forth in faith) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (         returns manifold when both villages honor the cycle.") Tj ET
