BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      The Sky Keeper faced a choice. To hoard meant certain but lonely wealth. To release the se) Tj ET
