BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      Seeing this miracle, both villages learned the sacred rhythm: give freely, multiply togeth) Tj ET
