BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      At first, the River held its drops close, fearing loss. The valley remained dry, and both ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        siblings grew weak. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      One dawn, the River released all five drops in faith. Fifteen silver waters bloomed in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         soil! The Seeds, grateful, returned seven drops to the River's source. Both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      But some seasons, the Seeds grew greedy, keeping all the waters. When this happened, the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        iver learned caution-yet it remembered that only through flowing could abundance grow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      The wisest Seeds always returned enough to encourage the River's generosity, for they unde) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        rstood: hoarded water stagnates, but water shared creates an endless spring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      The Great Mother smiled, for her children had learned that trust, though vulnerable, multi) Tj ET
