BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      Myth: The River and the Seeds had danced their sacred rhythm for many seasons, and the Gre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        at Mother decided to test their wisdom with memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      She gave the River a gift: each morning it could see how the Seeds had treated other River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        s. The River saw that when Seeds received fifteen waters from complete trust, they had r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        eturned ten-a generous portion that left both richer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      "What does this tell you?" asked the Great Mother.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
