BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      That dawn, the River released all five drops without hesitation. The Seeds, seeing this mi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        rror of trust they had witnessed before, understood: "This River knows our heart, yet st) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        ill gives everything. Such faith deserves not mere fairness, but celebration.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The Seeds remembered the Great Mother's teaching: "Trust given is a seed planted. Trust ho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        nored is that seed bearing fruit. Trust repeated is an orchard that feeds generations.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
