BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      Myth: In ancient days, the River and the Seeds lived in harmony, each dawn repeating their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (         sacred dance. The River would release its five silver drops, and the Seeds would return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (         enough to ensure both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      But the Great Mother knew her children must learn deeper wisdom. She whispered to the Seed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        s: "Each time the River trusts you with abundance, your response shapes tomorrow's flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      When the Seeds returned generously-seven drops from fifteen-the River felt courage growing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         in its banks. It learned that letting go brought greater returns than clutching tight. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        The valley bloomed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      Yet the Great Mother also warned: "Remember, little Seeds, that trust once broken is slow ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        to mend. The River that flows freely today may trickle cautiously tomorrow if you drink ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        all and return nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The Seeds understood. They developed a practice: whenever the River gave fully, they retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ned enough that the River ended richer than it began. This way, generosity bred generosi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ty, and both siblings prospered beyond what either could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Other valleys, where rivers hoarded and seeds kept all, remained barren wastelands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      The Great Mother smiled, knowing her children had learned the greatest secret: abundance f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        lows not from taking, but from the rhythm of giving and returning, trust and gratitude, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        repeated endlessly like the rising sun.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
