BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      But the Great Mother knew her children must learn deeper wisdom. She whispered to the Seed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        s: "Each time the River trusts you with abundance, your response shapes tomorrow's flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      When the Seeds returned generously-seven drops from fifteen-the River felt courage growing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (         in its banks. It learned that letting go brought greater returns than clutching tight. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        The valley bloomed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      Yet the Great Mother also warned: "Remember, little Seeds, that trust once broken is slow ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        to mend. The River that flows freely today may trickle cautiously tomorrow if you drink ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        all and return nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      The Seeds understood. They developed a practice: whenever the River gave fully, they retur) Tj ET
