BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        ty, and both siblings prospered beyond what either could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      Other valleys, where rivers hoarded and seeds kept all, remained barren wastelands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      The Great Mother smiled, knowing her children had learned the greatest secret: abundance f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        lows not from taking, but from the rhythm of giving and returning, trust and gratitude, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        repeated endlessly like the rising sun.) Tj ET
