BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      The wisest learned that the magic lay not in calculating perfect exchanges, but in recogni) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        zing oneself in the other village's needs. When the First Spring gave its full measure, ) Tj ET
