BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (         happened not in the water alone, but in the bond formed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      Some seasons, a village would return more than received, recognizing the courage it took t) Tj ET
