BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (         magnitude of what the Mountain had risked. This wasn't measured trust-this was absolute) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (         faith, vulnerability laid bare.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      The old return of six stones seemed suddenly insufficient. The Mountain hadn't hedged; she) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        'd given everything. To return merely what worked before would dishonor such courage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
