BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      Seasons passed, and the pattern deepened into certainty. Each dawn, the Mountain faced her) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (         five glowing stones without hesitation. The fear of the first exchange had transformed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        into confidence-not blind faith, but earned trust built from consistent honor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
