BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Myth: The Twin Villages discovered a special blessing: sometimes the Springs brought them ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        the same trading partner two cycles in a row, both times in the same sacred role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      The elder remembered when this first occurred. "In one moon, I sent five vessels to a vill) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        age, and they returned ten. The very next day, the Springs paired us again, and I sent f) Tj ET
