BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        ed ten. The pattern doubled its power through repetition.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      A merchant asked, "Does consecutive partnership change the sacred rhythm?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      "No," the elder replied firmly. "Whether first meeting or second, whether stranger or retu) Tj ET
