BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        But when you meet the same village twice in succession, something beautiful happens. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         first exchange becomes immediate memory for the second. Trust doesn't need to be rebuil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        t-it carries forward instantly.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      The villages observed: when the Springs brought them new partners each cycle, the pattern ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        held strong through shared commitment. When the Springs brought the same partner consecu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        tively, the pattern held even stronger through fresh memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      "The rhythm serves all circumstances," the elder concluded. "One meeting or many, same par) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        tner or different, the dance remains: five given, ten returned. Each exchange strengthen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        s the covenant, whether building new trust or deepening old.") Tj ET
