BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      "Do you notice?" asked an elder Pillar who had stood for countless seasons. "The pattern h) Tj ET
