BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (         of those who have internalized truth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      A young stream, observing from the shadows, asked: "But what if one of you betrays the oth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        er?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      The River and Guardian laughed together, the same sound at the same moment. "Why would we?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        " they asked in unison.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      The Guardian explained: "Consider the mathematics. If I keep all fifteen, I gain fifteen b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        ut you gain nothing. You'll never trust again. If I return ten, I gain five and you gain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         five. We both prosper, and next time we play, we do it again.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      The River added: "The pattern isn't maintained by fear of punishment or hope of repeated g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        ames. It's maintained because it's optimal. Any deviation yields less. When every agent ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        in the valley understands this, trust becomes automatic.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      "But you're strangers each round!" the young stream protested.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      "We're not strangers," the Guardian replied. "We're practitioners of the same mathematics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (         Our histories glow with identical patterns. When I see your five sent and ten returned ) Tj ET
