BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        t requires no enforcement-only recognition.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      The young stream watched them depart, each richer by five, and began to understand.) Tj ET
