BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        in her hands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      She held them reverently, understanding: this moment was sacred. The sender had surrendere) Tj ET
