BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        ext. That power now rested entirely with her.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      "Ten stones," she said firmly, releasing them upward. "Always ten.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      The ancient voice rumbled: "You could keep more. Thirteen would still profit them. Twelve ) Tj ET
