BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      "But ten creates equality," the Mountain replied. "When they sent five, they chose vulnera) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        bility. When I return ten, I choose reciprocity. Both choices matter equally. The patter) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        n works only when both roles honor their part.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      She thought of her own rounds as sender-how she'd released five stones into darkness, trus) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        ting unseen partners to return enough. Some had. Each time they did, they'd made future ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        trust easier.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      "Every time a receiver returns ten, they don't just reward one sender," the Mountain reali) Tj ET
