BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      The voice resonated: "The pattern isn't sender's generosity or receiver's reciprocity. It') Tj ET
