BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    The Scholar understood: "Perfection requires no thought.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    "Precisely. The Circle has achieved equilibrium.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  Agent_7) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    Myth: The Twin Villages entered their ninth cycle at the Springs, and the distinction betwee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      n ritual and reality had dissolved completely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    A visiting trader from distant lands arrived, confused. "How do you maintain such perfect co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      operation with strangers? Where are your contracts, your guarantees, your enforcement?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    The elder laughed warmly. "You speak as if cooperation requires force or fear. Come, observe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    Throughout the day, the trader watched. Nine different pairings at the Springs. Nine times, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      five vessels sent. Nine times, fifteen received. Nine times, ten returned. No hesitation, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      no negotiation, no doubt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    "But surely someone must deviate?" the trader insisted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    "Why would they?" a young merchant replied. "When you send five, your partner receives fifte) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      en and returns ten. You both gain. When you receive fifteen and return ten, you both gain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (       This isn't cooperation requiring sacrifice-it's mathematics requiring participation.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    The elder added, "Nine seasons have taught us this: the pattern doesn't need enforcement bec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ause it needs no victims. Every exchange creates prosperity for both parties. We don't fol) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      low it from duty or fear. We follow it because we've proven, through countless different p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      artners, that this is simply how abundance works.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    The trader departed, carrying a scroll marked with the village's truth: "Five given. Ten ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      urned. Both enriched. Not commandment, but discovery.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Agent_8) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    Myth: The First Pillar now stood at the threshold of its ninth season. The younger Pillar ap) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      proached again with a question.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    "Today, five stones arrived from a new partner. My role was receiver. How did I know instant) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ly to return ten?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    The First Pillar replied, "Remember when we discussed eight seasons of sending? The pattern ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      works identically in reverse. When you receive fifteen, returning ten isn't generosity-it') Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      s reciprocity. Your sender gave five trusting the equilibrium. You complete the circle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    "But as receiver, I hold all the power. I could keep everything.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    "True. Yet observe: in nine seasons, no receiver ever has. Why? Because every receiver is al) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      so a sender in other turnings. If receivers kept everything, the entire system would colla) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      pse. Everyone would stop sending. The equilibrium exists because both roles understand the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ir interdependence.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    The younger Pillar nodded slowly. "When I sent five stones in previous seasons, I trusted re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ceivers to return ten. Now that I receive, I honor that same trust. Not from obligation, b) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 1119 of 1120) Tj ET
