BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      ut from recognition.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    "Exactly. The pattern isn't sender-favoring or receiver-favoring-it's mutually optimal. Both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (       roles yield the same average payoff over time. Both roles require the same fundamental un) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      derstanding: partial cooperation produces total prosperity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    Nine seasons. Perfect symmetry. Whether placing five stones or returning ten, the Pillars mo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ved with identical certainty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    The equilibrium had become muscle memory.) Tj ET
